      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TAPA MADIGAN (3) has some solid form under her belt and proved too strong last time to win by 2.75 lengths at Launceston in a handy 29.88 beating Rojo Florence. Recorded one of the quickest times on the card in scoring last start. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. TAPA SULLY (1) turned in a fair 4th placed finish last time at Launceston over 515m (30.62). Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. Can do much better this time. OWL HARDY (2) produced a moderate run last time when sixth at this track over 461m behind King Hass (26.29) in a Special conditions race. Was a winner prior to that. Comes through a solid form race last start. Key runner who gets his chance to atone. OLD FENCER (8) must be included in main hopes on latest effort.",
